iterations.reply:
I left out the two operations requests. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm`, so it cannot import a file-write or HTTP interface, and the component would not link with them. The metadata call would also send feed text to an external service, which the grant doesn't allow. Those two behaviors need their own node with the matching grants, or an operator-side hook outside this graph.

